        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana UFBD3505, 3-1/2 Inch Transitional Brass Floor Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Transitional 3-1/2 Inch Door Stop is made out of solid brass and is available in a wide selection of finish colors. Its graceful design is stunning in any finish. This floor mounted door bumper is ideal for transitional decors. The 3-1/2 Inch Transitional Brass Floor Door Stop is easy to install by drilling a single hole. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFBD3505-specifications.gif?v=1704354647\" width=\"287\" height=\"290\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana UFBD3505 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana UFBD3505 3-1/2 Inch Floor Door Bumper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter at Top: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter at Bottom: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Height: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFBD3505-specifications.pdf?v=1704262417\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana UFBD3505 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
