                "title": "Transitional 3-1/2 Inch Door Stop",
                "description": "The Transitional 3-1/2 Inch Door Stop is made out of solid brass and is available in a wide selection of finish colors. Its graceful design is stunning in any finish. This floor mounted door bumper is ideal for transitional decors. The 3-1/2 Inch Transitional Brass Floor Door Stop is easy to install by drilling a single hole.",
